{"3686930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"頭七","steam_appid":3686930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4024140],"detailed_description":"<h1>关注我们<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >了解頭七最新进展，请关注：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·小红书：頭七官方<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·小黑盒：頭七官方<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·B站：頭七官方<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·玩家交流群1：954427152<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·玩家交流群2：703240148<\/p><\/p><br><h1>关于游戏<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《頭七》是一款中式民俗恐怖解谜游戏。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >作为刚入职西封杂志社的成员，你需要根据主编的要求，整合頭七论坛中民间灵异故事贴之间的关联，并在必要时与同伴实地探索，以揭开帖子后隐藏的秘密。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但请记住，你只是观察记录者，不干涉，不处理，不解决，也不要对事件中的人产生不必要的情感。<strong>因果循环，自作自受<\/strong>。<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【游戏介绍】<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/4f2886ec49b27d6708f1ca181ba985b1.poster.avif?t=1770966520\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/4f2886ec49b27d6708f1ca181ba985b1.webm?t=1770966520\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/4f2886ec49b27d6708f1ca181ba985b1.mp4?t=1770966520\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >西封杂志社旗下有个名为“头七”的论坛，用户会在其中分享自己所知的民俗怪谈、地方神灵，以及...那些他们曾经经历或是正在经历的“怪事”。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你可以在帖内回复，也可以和某些用户私聊，以探明帖子之间的联系。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/4c4f33198cf505688291d2b5407d981a.poster.avif?t=1770966520\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/4c4f33198cf505688291d2b5407d981a.webm?t=1770966520\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有时你也需要实地探查，找出场景中存在的线索道具、向当地人打听陈年往事。“佚名”的能力在调查中非常有用，你的队友也会为你提供很大助力，但，可不要太信任他们。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/e6a4d7571ec9ebdf1c0fd26327f18ce9.poster.avif?t=1770966520\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/e6a4d7571ec9ebdf1c0fd26327f18ce9.webm?t=1770966520\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/9182248f8a5fd005dc2d748ab2beae9c.webp?t=1770966520\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/9182248f8a5fd005dc2d748ab2beae9c.poster.avif?t=1770966520\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=458 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拼出线索，还原真相，解开“因”与“果”深处的秘密。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/8331b4c98099af24b59a7ab990abf9f4.poster.avif?t=1770966520\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930\/extras\/8331b4c98099af24b59a7ab990abf9f4.webm?t=1770966520\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3686930